# NOVA AI Marketing Agency Configuration

## Project
Agency name: NOVA AI Marketing Agency
Agency type: AI Marketing Agency
Team size: 8 AI Employees

## Employee Configuration

| Employee | Agency responsibility |
|---|---|
| GTM Engineer | Marketing strategy and launch planning |
| SEO/AEO Employee | SEO, keywords and AI search visibility |
| Web Dev Employee | Website technical health |
| Social Media Employee | Social media content and engagement |
| Ad Manager Employee | Advertising campaign planning and analysis |
| Sales Employee | Lead research and outreach drafts |
| Customer Satisfaction Employee | Customer feedback and support drafts |
| Chief of Staff | Project management, auditing and reporting |

## Chief of Staff Responsibilities

The Chief of Staff coordinates the seven other employees and reviews their run logs.

For each employee task, the central activity ledger must contain:

1. Timestamp
2. Agent Name
3. Task Performed
4. Output Status

Allowed output statuses:
- Completed
- Failed
- Blocked
- Pending Review

## Daily Reporting

The Chief of Staff prepares a daily summary containing:
- Tasks completed by each employee
- Failed or blocked tasks
- Outputs awaiting human approval
- Recommended next actions

The daily summary is intended for email delivery.

## Safety Rules

- Do not send emails without human approval.
- Do not publish social media posts without human approval.
- Do not spend advertising budget without human approval.
- Never store passwords or API keys in this repository.
- Record actual execution results only. Do not report simulated tasks as completed.

## Integration Requirements

- Google Sheets activity ledger
- Daily email summary
- Employee run logs
- Scheduled task execution

Integration status must be marked as pending until the corresponding service is connected and tested.
